{"id":"vod_sn_37376","vodId":"37376","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"成神之日","name_cn":"成神之日","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/07442d20e92a42f5f10823c9e8d51ec5.jpg"},"summary":"成神阳太（花江夏树 配音）是一位非常平凡的男子高中生，正在享受他高中生涯里的最后一个暑假。一天，正在篮球场打球的阳太邂逅了一位名叫佐藤雏（佐仓绫音 配音）神秘少女，少女告诉了阳太一个惊人的消息——“30天后，世界就会毁灭”。　　阳太收留了无家可归的雏，虽然对她的暴言半信半疑，但雏所展现出的准确的预知能力让阳太渐渐开始相信她所言非虚。个性沉稳成绩优异的伊座并杏子（石川由依 配音）、外表看似冷淡但实际上有着一副热心肠的国宝阿修罗（木村良平 配音）、总是懒懒散散大大咧咧的成神空（桑原由气 配音），雏很快就交到了一群好朋友。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:51:52","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tYryxBfx831/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TANCcrFT2j1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QBqearaSJi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JmstC9YgBj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3E9M2JWcdi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QRbDZfZ2Mt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7dw0PrUjPC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G1bJjw4dg91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fpu0cKp0Aw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HtuHeqfpNx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hxRfn3X8SS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pCrG34wxNc1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:11.406Z"}